\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs20\b0\i0 ASUS, 31/03/2026 7:53 PM\line \line }{\f1\fs24\b0\i0 ______________________}
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 BACKGROUND NOTES}
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 ______________________}
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 NOTE: The courier, is well disguised beyond human comprehension. Shielded from EF, and magnetic detection, slow moving yet undetectable by the sense that it projects a hardlight image, and emulates magnetically a blanket that constricts it\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2\uc1\u8217\'92s true intention. It doesn\u8217\'92t necessarily have to be hardlight it could be. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 _____________________________________________________________}
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 There should be something discreet that instills confidence in Tebo\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2\uc1\u8217\'92s plan to get the crew to Oasis, here The Gates are referred to as Couriers. To instill the image of a feasable and possible way out, given their current lack of knowledge in the Technology a plan is made with positive manipulation based on the limits and scopes of their current mental capacity. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 _____________________________________________________________}
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 The gate is disguised as a passing asteroid, at which the beverly enters into cloaking it\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2\uc1\u8217\'92s journey. The grey class ship; trails the beverly based on light distortion tracking, the ships engines are far advanced , thus leaving no vapour or gaseous decay signature, all these bi products of the drice are captured while operating in cloaked mode, with the reduced low enerfy consumption. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 - Space tracking of vessels and asteroids. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 - Ground based radar, reveals distance velocity and shape rotation. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 Counter measures, }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 EM tracking would need to be deflected or cloaked by a continued projection of the incoming magnetic field. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 - This could be used to detect an incoming ship but, at a cost of giving away postiion, on a hot burn this would be the time to use such a technology. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i1 The skin of the ship would beed to counter the EM tech in that moment when it went cold, the AI modes of the ship would only be primitive. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 _____________________________________________________________ }
